===Iran vs Spain===
[[File:Iran and Spain match at the FIFA World Cup (5).jpg|thumb|[[Vahid Amiri]] vs [[Isco]]]]
The two teams had never met before.<ref name=Kit/>

Spain had their first attempt on goal in the 25th minute when [[David Silva]]'s long-range free-kick was held by [[Alireza Beiranvand]]. Five minutes later, Silva's volley sailed narrowly over the crossbar from six yards out. At the start of the 2nd half, [[Gerard Piqué]]'s close-range effort was blocked and then Beiranvand palmed away [[Sergio Busquets]]' curled effort from the edge of the penalty area. [[Karim Ansarifard]]'s effort from a corner flashed into [[David de Gea]]'s side netting. In the 54th minute, [[Diego Costa]] picked up [[Andrés Iniesta]]'s pass inside the area and saw [[Ramin Rezaeian]]'s attempted clearance ricochet off his leg and past Beiranvand low into the left corner of the net. [[Saeid Ezatolahi]] pulled Iran level shortly after the hour but his close-range finish after a scramble was ruled out courtesy of VAR after Rezaeian was found in an offside position. [[Mehdi Taremi]]'s back-post header fizzed over De Gea's crossbar seven minutes from time as Iran pushed for an equaliser, but Spain held on for a 1–0 win.<ref name="Goal Iran v Spain">{{cite web |last=Atkinson |first=Guy |title=Costa goal breaks stubborn resistance |url=http://www.goal.com/en-in/match/iran-v-spain/emspb08v5pfisguzn2zkj1qsp |website=Goal.com |date=20 June 2018}}</ref><ref name="IRN-ESP recap">{{cite web |url=https://inside.fifa.com/tournaments/mens/worldcup/2018russia/news/costa-on-target-to-give-spain-victory-2963598 |title=Costa on target to give Spain victory |publisher=FIFA |date=20 June 2018 |access-date=20 June 2018 |url-status=live |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20260520045250/https://inside.fifa.com/tournaments/mens/worldcup/2018russia/news/costa-on-target-to-give-spain-victory-2963598 |archive-date=20 May 2026}}</ref>

Iran did not manage a shot on target for the first time in 14 World Cup games.<ref>{{cite web |last=Reddy |first=Luke |title=Iran 0 Spain 1 |url=https://www.bbc.com/sport/football/44439093 |work=BBC Sport |date=20 June 2018}}</ref>

